WEBVTT

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:09.460
So this is... a grimoire.

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:10.920
Yep.

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:15.540
It's a very convenient item that can forcibly awaken
new magic within whoever reads it.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:19.500
Of course, there's no way of knowing
exactly what kind of magic that will be.

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:24.500
B-but... an item this precious would
be wasted on the likes of me...

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.420
I thought I made myself clear.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:30.170
You're going to be a burden to the party if providing
a level-boost is the only thing you can do.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:35.380
It doesn't matter what magic you obtain.
It can be a heal spell or an attack spell.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:37.330
Just read this and expand your skill set.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.500
Because whatever it is may save the lives of your friends.

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:45.380
If you really want to stand up for your Familia,
then you should do whatever it takes.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.460
Forget about what other people think.
Let yourself be greedy and play dirty.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.710
Go on. Hurry up and read it.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:54.460
Then we'll get to practicing your new magic.

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:57.330
Okay.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:26.210
<b>Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? В IV</b>

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:43.380
<b>Argo Vesta</b>

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:43.380
<b>Heroic Slash of Holy Flame</b>

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:45.250
Here I go.

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:47.170
Kokonoe!

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:10.170
Oh beloved snow, oh beloved crimson,
oh beloved light...

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.290
Please allow me to stay by thine side.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:16.080
Those fond feelings discovered
after two thousand nights.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:20.130
My name is fox spirit, a destructor of long past.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:23.380
My name is folk song, a desire of long past.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:26.210
For the good of thou who spreads thine wings like a bird,

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:29.040
I shall harbor the demon of nine within me.

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:34.000
Resound, golden melody. Call forth Tamamo.

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:36.920
The white-faced, yellow-haired king of nine tails!

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:41.540
Oh mythical beast, may your tails
consume all and grant every wish!

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.080
Let them grow.

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:46.420
She connected them!

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.630
Bless the vessel with divine power.

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:52.630
A tower of riches for a tower of wishes.

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:55.460
Until the tolling of the bell,

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.670
I call upon thy glory and illusion.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:00.960
Let them grow!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.710
This golden light provided by the gods above,

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:06.170
for this body that has devoured divine gifts.

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:09.380
With the pounding of a mallet into the ground,

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:11.880
may thou be blessed with good fortune!

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:27.080
From what I can tell, this magic spell is one that works
in conjunction with others that you already know.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.380
Does that mean it's like an enchantment?

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.250
Yep!

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.420
Right now, Haruhime is capable
of growing out five of those tails.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:39.290
Which means that she can cast
her Level Boost spell on up to five different people!

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:41.790
Let them grow!

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.040
Uchide no Kozuchi!

00:04:58.460 --> 00:04:59.580
Dance and whirl!

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:05.420
Perfect!

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:13.540
Hell yeah! We got this!

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:37.920
Uh, what just happened?

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.380
Wait a minute, did her magic multiply...?

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:44.000
Remember what Lady Aisha said.
You're to keep this a secret.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:51.130
It's our ace in the hole that's
going to help us get back alive.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:04.960
We managed to bounce back.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.420
We stand a shot of getting out of here if we keep this up.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:09.960
It's just a question of what that Moss Huge is gonna do...

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:12.670
There it is!

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.630
What the hell is it doing?

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:26.880
Oh dammit, we fell for it! It was after the magic
stones of the monsters that we defeated all along!

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.210
This isn't good!

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:13.580
Lady Aisha!

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:20.330
How many times is this thing gonna catch us off guard?!

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:34.710
Lady Aisha...

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:54.960
I really screwed up...

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:00.920
The parasite plant!

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:08.210
You damn ugly freak.

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:09.250
Move it!

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:11.170
KOGA!

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:25.330
It managed to survive that attack?!

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.750
An Undine Cloth!

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.500
That rat bastard!

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:35.580
It stole from dead adventurers!

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.460
This couldn't get any worse.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:46.790
Monsters incoming!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:21.540
We're in trouble.

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.500
This might be the end...

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.880
It's crazy that she can cast Level Boost
on multiple people now.

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:37.630
It's pretty much like the Ishtar Familia's wish came true!

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:39.420
Yeah. But you know...

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:42.420
We need to be extra careful about when we decide to
use it.

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:47.420
I think it's going to become our last resort.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:51.880
Which means that if the scales
don't start to tip in our favor after using it...

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:55.170
Right. That wouldn't be good.

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.830
Well, I bet we won't even have to use it!

00:09:58.210 --> 00:10:03.250
I find it hard to imagine you guys getting into
any serious trouble with Bell and Aisha around!

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:13.330
This is looking kinda bad!

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:15.580
We're going to get overrun!

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:23.000
Soul Light!

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:40.170
Think... there has to be something we can do!

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:44.580
As the strategist, I need to find a way to turn this around!

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.630
Get your weapons ready, guys.

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:53.880
Master Dormul?

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:08.040
Let us help. We'd have already died a long time ago
if you guys hadn't come along.

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.130
I feel the same.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:12.170
I may be missing an arm,
but I can at least act as a shield.

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:14.000
Absolutely not! Just stay put!

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.790
We'll draw their attention,
so make a run for it when there's a chance!

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:39.630
Somebody has to make it back to the surface
and let them know about that monster!

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.920
So focus on surviving! As many of you as possible!

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:47.290
Now go and leave us behind! Hestia Familia!

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:19.920
Run for it!

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:22.210
You have to survive!

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:24.080
Leave us behind!

00:12:27.210 --> 00:12:30.630
We're about to enter the lower floors, which are
something that even we don't have experience with.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:32.880
That makes it hard to predict what will happen.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:36.580
And the strategist needs to take the worst possible
scenarios into account.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:38.750
Worst possible scenarios?

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:42.290
Yeah. The dungeon is a cruel tyrant.

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:45.380
There are going to be times
when you have to be heartless.

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:49.500
That being said, I think you're capable
of making level-headed decisions.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.920
They're right. We should just run.

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:01.460
It's far from the first time that
we've done something underhanded.

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:04.460
So there's no reason to hesitate now.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:09.000
And I know that Master Bell won't fault us for it...

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:35.580
He would never leave anyone behind.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:40.420
I would know because he never
abandoned me! And that's why...

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:43.210
I have to change! I have to follow his example!

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:44.920
So listen!

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:46.210
I've decided!

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:48.960
I'm not leaving any of you here to die!

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:51.330
I refuse to give up and run away!

00:13:56.960 --> 00:14:00.710
That's my job... because I'm his Supporter!

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:03.920
Way to state the obvious, Lil Squeak!

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:10.960
Lady Lili... he's coming.

00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:15.500
I can hear him. It's Master Bell!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.290
LILI!

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.080
Hurry! Take cover!

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.540
Lady Aisha! Find some cover!

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:59.630
FIREBOLT!

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:21.880
Master... Bell...

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:24.250
Master Bell!

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:25.830
Master Bell.

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:29.790
Master Bell!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:31.670
Thank you.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:42.460
I hate to sit this out, but it's up to you. Bell Cranel.

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:48.000
Guess we're not ready to manage without him just yet!

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:32.580
There they go.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:37.170
Hey, isn't anybody going down there to help him?

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:38.960
Don't bother.

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:42.960
If that monster shoots more of those seeds and infects
whoever goes to help,

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:45.210
they'll only be a problem for Bell Cranel.

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:47.420
Y-you're not wrong, but...

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:52.710
What about shooting some arrows, or using that Level
Boost from earlier? There has to be a way to help!

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:57.290
Leaving the Little Rookie to fight that
enhanced monster all by himself is too cruel...

00:16:57.580 --> 00:16:59.960
W-wait, Daphne. Look closer.

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:00.670
Huh?

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:14.830
I'm confused. Didn't that monster get powered up
from eating all those magic stones?

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:17.170
It definitely did, but at the same time...

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:21.040
Bell Cranel's moves have improved
to a point even beyond that!

00:17:21.460 --> 00:17:23.500
Sometimes when using Level Boost,

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:28.170
I've noticed my senses can't fully process all
of the strength that my ranked up body has.

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:32.750
I wonder if Master Bell has felt
a similar imbalance this whole time.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:37.250
Like maybe he's always been fighting while his mind
and his physique are at odds with each other.

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:38.210
There's no way...

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:39.460
It sounds plausible to me.

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:42.580
Bell has ranked up multiple times
in a ridiculously short amount of time.

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:45.710
Having trouble adjusting to that is totally natural.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:50.500
So going through intense fighting on the lower floors
finally made all the pieces fall into place for him, huh?

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:52.960
Good grief. It's almost laughable.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:54.880
Master Bell...

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:03.000
Something inside of me
changed ever since that moment...

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:10.960
The discomfort I was feeling is gone!

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:27.000
It's slower than the Iguazu!

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.170
And in terms of power...

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:34.500
That guy I fought before was way stronger than this!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:49.210
I want to beat him!

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:51.580
I want to win! The next time we fight!

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:26.460
Kickass!
Incredible!<b></b>

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:27.170
Outstanding!

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:34.580
It can still regenerate after that?!

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:36.670
What an absolute monstrosity...

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:40.500
Master Bell's stamina and magic power
aren't at their fullest right now!

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:42.380
A prolonged fight won't be good for him!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:44.500
He'll have to wipe it out with a single strike.

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:52.420
Firebolt.

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:12.380
The flames are all focused around his knife...

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:14.540
An enchantment? No, it can't be.

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:15.830
What is that?

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:19.540
But even though it transmits magic well, that doesn't
mean it can be magically empowered.

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:24.130
The blade will just disperse
any magic that you try to imbue it with.

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:25.710
Bell...

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:27.290
Are you doing what I think you are?

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:34.460
Goddess.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:36.170
Vesta...

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:40.960
Oh, nothing! Seeing you in this moment
just made me feel like saying that.

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:47.960
It's a symbol of all the things I preside over,
while also being a title, and another name that I go by.

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:51.000
I'm going to borrow that name of yours.

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:55.750
HIYO!

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:02.290
You're not going anywhere!

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:05.630
Let's end this.

00:21:08.460 --> 00:21:09.960
Argo Vesta.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:32.540
Master Bell!
Way to go!<b>
That was awesome!</b>

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:38.130
Chigusa!

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:40.130
Ouka...

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:40.830
Hey!

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:47.920
Master Bell!

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:48.630
Bell!

00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:49.420
Guys!

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:54.040
Thank you, Bell.

00:21:54.130 --> 00:21:55.250
I love you!

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:40.040
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:40.040
<b>Rabbit's Foot</b>

00:23:36.670 --> 00:23:38.960
Next time: "Rabbit's Foot."
